.Sh BUGS
.Cm check ,
.Cm node\-types
and
.Cm c
read a packed grammar as
.Pa .scm
source and use memory until an allocation fails.
.Pp
A diagnostic from an
.Li (error NAME)
extra is recorded again each time the parser backtracks over the same bytes,
so one error node can have several
.Ql extra.error
diagnostics.
A
.Li recover
form that applies at several nesting levels at the end of the input reports
its diagnostic more than once:
.Pa examples/recover/list.scm
reports it 3 times for
.Ql ((a
and 7 times for
.Ql (((a .
